      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 51.133,
      "text": "苏格拉底其实\n就是非常有智慧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 54.5,
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 52.733,
      "text": "是吧？当然从\n来不给别人答案"
